  {
   "id": "fantasy-aquarium-319878@1.11",
   "gameId": "fantasy-aquarium-319878",
   "displayName": "Update 1.11",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-24T02:47:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Add the function of switching between regular fonts. Settings ->Language&Fonts ->Turn off Pixel Fonts, note that there may be lag when turned on for the first time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.The fish ticket quantity button has been accelerated and optimized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. The background music player has added a loop playback button, which allows users to choose between single loop and loop playback as needed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Add fish detail data to the image guide interface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
