       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The bug where double the amount of money would be deducted when upgrading the fish tank in certain situations has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. An option to choose the language before entering the game has been added before starting the game and reopening the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
